 "titulo": "The lantern that keeps a dragon asleep 🏮 Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "NEVER LET IT GO OUT",
 "descripcion": "In a mountain village, one lantern has burned every night for three hundred years. Lin thought the river dragon was just a story. Then he fell asleep.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you stay awake?\n\nAn original tale inspired by Chinese river dragon folklore.\n#folktales #mythology #chinesemythology #story #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a mountain village where *one lantern* must never go out.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "It hangs at the old temple above the river, and it burns every night.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "For three hundred years, someone has kept it lit.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The villagers say it keeps the *river dragon* asleep.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "By day, the river is calm, and children fish from the bridge.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "This year the keeper is old *Master Wu*, and his helper is a boy named *Lin*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Lin thinks the dragon is just a story to scare children.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Every night he climbs the stairs with oil, and every night he yawns.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because one night Lin breaks the oldest rule in the village.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Master Wu falls sick, and Lin must keep the lantern alone.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At midnight the wind is strong, and Lin is very tired.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He sits on the temple steps, just for a moment, and closes his eyes.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "When he wakes up, *the lantern is dark*.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "And down in the river, something enormous opens *one golden eye*.",
   "pausa": 0.7
  },
  {
   "texto": "What does the dragon do when it wakes? Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
